          "text": "<p>Moving away from<em> fast fashion</em>, we&#x27;re focused on connecting our customers and community with special, well-made pieces to add to your wardrobe not for just one season, but forever. Our goal is to help you curate a closet with fewer but better items. To design and craft our pieces, we work with local artists, independent designers and a skilled team of seamstresses. Our company believes in creating easy-to-wear, timeless pieces and being transparent of where your product came from and who made it.</p>",
